  "zh": "# AI攻克黎曼猜想引发争议，英伟达市值暴跌千亿，特朗普点赞深圳引发中美基建对比热议\n## AI前沿\n- **AI证明黎曼猜想**：Claude声称形式化验证通过，但数学界质疑证明长度超25万页不可读，Anthropic股价反跌市场不买账\n- **英伟达市值大跌**：单日蒸发一个亚马逊市值创2001年以来最大跌幅，SEC会计调查叠加AI泡沫担忧引发抛售潮\n- **大模型自主重写权重**：最新论文证实LLM可在推理时修改自身参数，迈出递归自我进化关键一步\n## 地缘宏观\n- **特朗普点赞深圳**：APEC晚宴高呼\"看看深圳再看看我们\"，又称不支持台独，中美基建差距与台海表态双双引爆舆论\n- **顺丰停军采购资格**：被暂停全军采购活动资格，头部物流企业合规红线前翻车，军采供应链审查趋严\n## 消费市场\n- **胖东来搬离引连锁倒闭**：原址商场租金腰斩仍无人接盘，网红超市\"带货光环\"消退暴露商业地产虚火\n- **信用卡发卡量锐减**：近一年少发3400万张，移动支付普及与消费降级双重挤压下，银行信贷模式被迫转型",
  "en": "# AI Riemann proof claim sparks debate, Nvidia loses $1T value, Trump praises Shenzhen igniting US-China infrastructure comparison\n## AI & Frontier Tech\n- **AI Proves Riemann Hypothesis**: Claude claims formal verification success, but mathematicians question 250k-page unreadable proof; Anthropic shares drop as market stays skeptical\n- **Nvidia Market Cap Plunges**: Single-day wipeout equals Amazon's value, worst chip crash since 2001; SEC accounting probe fuels AI bubble fears\n- **LLMs Rewrite Own Weights**: New paper shows models modifying their own parameters at inference, a key step toward recursive self-improvement\n## Geopolitics & Macro\n- **Trump Praises Shenzhen**: At APEC dinner he urges \"look at Shenzhen then look at us\" and rejects Taiwan independence, sparking viral debate on US infrastructure gap and cross-strait policy\n- **SF Express Loses Military Procurement Eligibility**: Top logistics firm suspended from all-military purchasing, signaling stricter compliance scrutiny on defense supply chains\n## Consumer & Market\n- **Fat Donglai Exit Triggers Mall Collapse**: Vacated mall slashes rent 60% yet finds no tenants, revealing the fragility of celebrity-driven commercial real estate hype\n- **Credit Card Issuance Plummets**: 34M fewer cards issued in a year as mobile payments and consumption downgrade force banks to rethink lending models"
